    "text": "<p>Production of iron in blast furnace follows the following equation</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>CO</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>Fe</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>640</mn><mi>kg</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>520</mn><mi>kg</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CO</mi></math> are allowed to react then the amount of iror (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>) produced is :</p><p>[Given: Molar Atomic mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msup><mi>gmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mi>Fe</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>56</mn></math></p><p>Molar Atomic mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msup><mi>gmolm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p>Molar Atomic mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msup><mi>gmolm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math>]</p>"
